{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sf393ab16663e957e","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-b82804b3a19214feb7df","text":"（将照片发给三月七）","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-bbefbcfae2ccf4f025a7","text":"快看！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-c4a651e74d53588a86ca","text":"哇！！！这是什么？好可爱","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-4de54a947d1c682df979","text":"怎么和我长得有点像","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-675dace09adc720e80d8","text":"是你特意给它打扮的？","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-67521025380c37452469","text":"当然不是！你怎么会这么想","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-e3b0600b889384f310cf","text":"天生可爱。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-e879f2f60e9444a3d630","text":"这小家伙是阮•梅女士创造的生命体，生来就这么可爱","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-80f8369139d0717cf73e","text":"哇！","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-dcb11616bb06b2ce504a","text":"要不你把它带回列车上转转呗，我想抱着它拍个合照！","speaker":"三月七"}]}
